      "derivation": "For LED0: OFF_L=0x00, OFF_H=0x04 => duty = (0x04 & 0x0F)*256 + 0x00 = 4*256 = 1024. For LED1: OFF_L=0x00, OFF_H=0x00 => duty = 0."
