      "derivation": "For LED0: OFF_L=0xFF, OFF_H=0x0F => duty = (0x0F & 0x0F)*256 + 0xFF = 15*256 + 255 = 4095. For LED1: OFF_L=0xFF, OFF_H=0x0F => duty = 4095."
